# oracle: fix gcmc in units metal, Lambda at the first-insertion threshold: the same insertion into an empty box is rejected with mu just below and accepted just above the native threshold (mu* = -0.16210844608182 eV; the 2019 SI h would move it up by 5.5e-9 eV)
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=none rel=1e-8
units metal
atom_style atomic
pair_style lj/cut 3.0
pair_modify tail no
region box block 0 5 0 5 0 5
create_box 1 box
pair_coeff * * 0.0 1.0
mass 1 1.0
group gcmcgroup type 1
thermo_style custom step atoms
thermo 1
thermo_modify format float %.15g
fix below gcmcgroup gcmc 1 1 0 1 29494 300.0 -0.1621084485 1.0
run 1
unfix below
fix above gcmcgroup gcmc 1 1 0 1 29494 300.0 -0.1621084435 1.0
run 1
